Go is not actually all that obscure outside the US, and certainly
not in the Lojban community.  You're really going to have to try
harder.  :)

I enjoy Go, but am impossibly bad.  I mean that literally: I was
playing Go online regularily for several months, and was still 28
kyu.  I was informed (in a friendly fashion) by the person teaching
me that that was impossible: everyone progresses to about 25 kyu
over their first few games, but I had played dozens by that time.
:)

-Robin

